0030:     Rule:
0031:     - Split the data region into four equal quadrants.
0032:     - For every data-colored pixel, replace it with the color in the same top/bottom and
0033:       left/right position of the 2x2 legend.
0034:     - Keep the background, divider, and legend unchanged.
